#### a variant colliding with a FUNCTION, not a struct

- Verify: a variant colliding with a FUNCTION, not a struct
   - Expected: wrap(Shadowed.Solo).tag == Shadowed.Solo is true


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

